    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2>The main goal of the game is continuous progression through stages, achievable through strategic management. <br>Strengthen your army in every possible way and advance further on the path to endless glory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>First and foremost, you will need to recruit units into your army. <br>Choose your units wisely. Each unit has different characteristics with both strengths and weaknesses. After assembling your army, battles become accessible.<br>In battles, your army fight with enemies automatically. Upon victory over enemy units and completion of each stage, you earn gold, which can be used to enhance your army.<br>The strongest players will be shown on the leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Direct control over units is not available, so you need to strengthen your army through other means:<br>1) By upgrading skills, you can improve the characteristics of your units.<br>2) After acquiring spells, you can use them in battle to enhance your units or harm the enemy.<br>3) In the armory, you can purchase and equip items that provide additional capabilities to your units and enhance their characteristics.<br>4) You can also appoint a general to your army, who will strengthen specific aspects of your units or provide additional abilities, not presented before.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2>Once an hour, you can undertake challenge. In a challenge your army faces big wave of reinforced enemies. Winning in this trials rewards you with gold and crystals, which can be spent in a separate shop to acquire unique additional capabilities to aid you in battles. Challenges also progress with the strength of your army, allowing you to advance further and further.",
